                                Assets:Investments     -23983.16 EUR -54310.95 EUR
18-Sep-24 Sold FOO              Assets:Investments      -283.44 EUR -54594.39 EUR
                                Assets:Investments       -87.21 EUR -54681.60 EUR
end test
